s, inks, laundry, cosmetics, etc.; surfactants in various concentrations and forms, including alpha olefin sulfonates and lauryl ether sulfates; specialty chemicals; and various grades of detergent powders, liquid detergents and bars, dishwashing liquid and bars, and scouring powders, as well as dry mix detergents. It also owns and operates six wind turbine generators with a capacity of 4.3 MW in Tamil Nadu. The company also exports its products. Ultramarine & Pigments Limited was incorporated in 1960 and is based in Mumbai, India."}}